                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The failure has a\nshape now. People\ndid their jobs,\nbut one frozen",
                                  "link silenced them\nall. Dot does not\ncelebrate being\nright. She asks",
                                  "for a second path\nbefore anyone asks\nfor a bigger bell.\nPip makes",
                                  "space for her name\non the plan."
                                ],
