                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "A repossessed\nservice sled sits\nbehind the depot\ngate. Slush\ncovered",
                                  "its storage\ncharges, then a\nclerk marked the\nsled as\ncollateral.",
                                  "Moxie remembers\ndriving it. She\nalso remembers its\nleft runner,",
                                  "which expresses\nopinions on\ncorners."
